      "trigger": "The first raw BEGIN with R2676_BEGIN_EVIDENCE unset, or an unwritable/invalid diagnostic destination, or diagnostic encoding/projection failure.",
      "proof": "The added observer calls System.fetch_env! and File.write! without local rescue/catch. It runs before the unchanged transaction writer. The exact telemetry dependency catches handler exceptions at telemetry.erl:201-205 and calls detach(HandlerId). The ordinary canonical hosted/scripts/test-local.py supplies the older evidence variables but contains no R2676_BEGIN_EVIDENCE setting.",
