      "requested_change": "Treat an unset diagnostic destination as disabled. Contain projection, encoding and file I/O failures within the new optional observer so the preexisting handler always continues; preserve the original assertions and existing writer. Do not add a mandatory R2676 campaign variable to ordinary CI.",
